# "the results must remain private. NO LEAKING THE DATA."
# This repo has a public-facing GitHub remote and is destined for GitHub Pages.
# Verify before every commit:  git check-ignore -v testcasefull.csv
testcasefull.csv
*full.csv
/real/
**/real-data/
/tmp-data/

# Real exports and the real grouping structure. testcase.csv is 86 rows of a
# genuine export (real values, real area codes); Groupings.csv is the utility's
# actual area -> grouping rollup. Both stay local. The tests build their own
# synthetic export and mapping in test_fixtures.mjs — nothing data-shaped is
# tracked in this repo.
testcase.csv
Groupings.csv

# ── ARCHIVED EXPLORATION — untracked by design ──────────────────────
# The feasibility spike: benchmark harnesses, generators, raw result JSON,
# and the two superseded planning docs (orchestrate.md, spec.md).
# Nothing here is needed for normal development.
/archive/

